      ],
      "notes": "Clicky Flaretech switch with a Cherry MX Blue style inner slider and click leaf; the click comes at 1.8 mm down and 0.5 mm on the way back. On Wooting boards the Lens B version reads analog travel, so actuation is set between 1.5 and 3.6 mm (Tom's Hardware lists 1.6 to 3.6 mm). The switch holds no electronics: the PCB carries the infrared sensor and the LED, whose light runs up a light guide. It fits only Flaretech sockets."
